<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS views cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS views cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Wednesday analyst Joseph Bellace had cut his estimate for Cisco Systems Inc's 1997 earnings per share (EPS) to $2.05 from $2.07.</p>
<p>-- He also trimmed his 1998 EPS estimate to a range of $2.60-$2.70 from $2.65-$2.75.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the San Jose, Calif., networking company rose 3/8 to 58-1/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
